ame question Christine! How weird to have students hitting on you! wow!","Attachments":[],"Id":23982,"PostDate":1170831353,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I was going to ask you the same question Christine! How weird to have students hitting on you! wow!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"clb26@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"67.182.138.230","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1148516640,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"A10CalGal","Id":206736,"Name":"A10CalGal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":1766,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4a5314ca5d60230fbac99b5bbcd972b8","RawContent":"I have two in one class that always try to hug me and call me their boo...they are just jokers and I just brush it off, sometimes I feel uncomfortable but the worst was my first semester teaching I found out that one of my female student declared her love for me on myspace. it wasn&#039;t that it was a girl, it was that she broadcasted it out there on the internet and I was still a new teacher and at the time I was teaching in a really conservative town...I didn&#039;t get a myspace for a couple of years after that.","Attachments":[],"Id":23983,"PostDate":1170831516,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I have two in one class that always try to hug me and call me their boo...they are just jokers and I just brush it off, sometimes I feel uncomfortable but the worst was my first semester teaching I found out that one of my female student declared her love for me on myspace. it wasn't that it was a girl, it was that she broadcasted it out there on the internet and I was still a new teacher and at the time I was teaching in a really conservative town...I didn't get a myspace for a couple of years after that.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<strong>Christine + Will (married 7\/20\/07) + Ainsleigh (born 6\/25\/08) + Nolan (born 11\/9\/10) + Delaney (born 12\/31\/13) = One Very Happy Family!<\/strong>","Email":"christine@dc-hulls.com","IpAddress":"167.154.70.240","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1165989180,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206965.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Christine","Id":206965,"Name":"Christine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":1766,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"090e67194a910ad480a9b5d88d9f9171","RawContent":"OH MY GAWD!!! That is nuts! Myspace is such a weird thing. I am really appreciating it for the fact that I&#039;m finding lots of my old school pals. I monitor my soon to be step-sons myspace &amp;amp; it&#039;s hilarious how relationships are made &amp;amp; broken as quickly as they can change their &amp;quot;status&amp;quot; from single to in a relationship or vice versa. Crazy!","Attachments":[],"Id":23988,"PostDate":1170832151,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                OH MY GAWD!!! That is nuts! Myspace is such a weird thing. I am really appreciating it for the fact that I'm finding lots of my old school pals. I monitor my soon to be step-sons myspace & it's hilarious how relationships are made & broken as quickly as they can change their \"status\" from single to in a relationship or vice versa. Crazy!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"clb26@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"67.182.138.230","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1148516640,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"A10CalGal","Id":206736,"Name":"A10CalGal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":1766,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c7c535e81f372b16673d0e2916005ce7","RawContent":"yes teenagers are crazy","Attachments":[],"Id":23990,"PostDate":1170832190,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                yes teenagers are crazy\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<strong>Christine + Will (married 7\/20\/07) + Ainsleigh (born 6\/25\/08) + Nolan (born 11\/9\/10) + Delaney (born 12\/31\/13) = One Very Happy Family!<\/strong>","Email":"christine@dc-hulls.com","IpAddress":"167.154.70.240","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1165989180,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206965.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Christine","Id":206965,"Name":"Christine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":1766,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"94ebed501775614ca3d523204b1ef822","RawContent":"Wow - I have to admit, that&#039;s kind of funny. Probably not for you, Christine, at least not when it happened - but what a funny story!\n \n I signed up for MySpace, but I am NEVER on there.","Attachments":[],"Id":23998,"PostDate":1170836474,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Wow - I have to admit, that's kind of funny. Probably not for you, Christine, at least not when it happened - but what a funny story!<br \/> <br \/> I signed up for MySpace, but I am NEVER on there.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/anns-annr-las-caletas-dreams-pv-hawaii-review-looooooong-6068\/'>Ann's Caletas Wedding & Hawaii Honeymoon Review<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.leighmillerphotography.com\/darkroom\/share\/?n=ann_paul'>Our Caletas Wedding Slideshow (by Leigh Miller)<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.onetruemedia.com\/shared?p=31de360c85cec8376c35a5&skin_id=701&utm_source=otm&utm_medium=image'>Our Caletas Wedding Video<\/a>","Email":"annkherrick@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"76.16.7.43","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1161396480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206863.jpg?_r=1429384252","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LCBride2007","Id":206863,"Name":"LCBride2007","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":1766,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1855455911986df1401a737b2c2950e8","RawContent":"that is too funny!! Christine, I used to run an after-school program and this third grader would tell me on a daily basis that I was his girlfriend and that he loved me.. He would run and hug me all the time. Like you, i would try to brush it off and giggle at it but one time he went too far and asked if &amp;quot;we could make babies&amp;quot; Can you believe that&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; I had no clue how to handle that one!","Attachments":[],"Id":24000,"PostDate":1170836975,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                that is too funny!! Christine, I used to run an after-school program and this third grader would tell me on a daily basis that I was his girlfriend and that he loved me.. He would run and hug me all the time. Like you, i would try to brush it off and giggle at it but one time he went too far and asked if \"we could make babies\" Can you believe that<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> I had no clue how to handle that one!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Photo by <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.monicamartinphotography.com\/blog'>www.monicamartinphotography.com\/blog<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f128\/amyhs-planning-galore-24132\/index10.html'>Planning Pics!<\/a> <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/amyhs-puerto-vallarta-wedding-more-review-works-25255\/index4.html'>PV and Wedding Review<\/a><strong class='bbc'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/picasaweb.google.com\/amyhmartin\/ProfessionalWeddingPictures?authkey=w0DgS3ao1sI#'>Pro Pics (1)<\/a>; <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/picasaweb.google.com\/amyhmartin\/ProfessionalWeddingPictures2?authkey=vbG3xUMVk1s#'>Pro Pics (2)<\/a><\/strong> <strong class='bbc'>By Nataly Lemus Photography and Rodolfo Arpia Photography<\/strong> <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/natalylemusphoto.blogspot.com\/2008\/07\/amy-hanssel-married.html'>Teaser Pro Pics from Nataly Lemus Photogaphy<\/a><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.arpiaphotoblog.com\/2008\/07\/puerto-vallarta-destination-wedding_3102.html'>Teaser Pro Pics from Rodolfo Arpia Photography<\/a>","Email":"amyhmartin@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.119.192.139","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1162175640,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206875.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amyh","Id":206875,"Name":"amyh","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"1766","Title":"Joke of the day: \"Father of my kids\"","LastPostDate":1408107274},"Pages":{"TotalItems":35,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
