ried, at either of these resorts in Cayo Coco. We are trying to decide between the two. Would love to hear someone&#039;s review and pictures. Hope some of you are out there. :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1750997,"PostDate":1366954446,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi girls. Are there any of you out there getting married, or have already been married, at either of these resorts in Cayo Coco. We are trying to decide between the two. Would love to hear someone's review and pictures. Hope some of you are out there. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"steelejess@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"142.68.111.184","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1350865562,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261604.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jesteele","Id":261604,"Name":"jesteele","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73737,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a1328e917270f4dd99f0db8d9fdf926d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; FYI. Our wedding will be March 2014.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1750998,"PostDate":1366954511,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> FYI. Our wedding will be March 2014.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"steelejess@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"142.68.111.184","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1350865562,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261604.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jesteele","Id":261604,"Name":"jesteele","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.30.118.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73737,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9d53631d0b63f4d70efd160496fa8dee","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Just wondering if you ended up getting married in Cayo Coco? Would love to hear all about it as we are getting hitched at Memories Flamenco in Cayo Coco next May!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1854608,"PostDate":1402427871,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Just wondering if you ended up getting married in Cayo Coco? Would love to hear all about it as we are getting hitched at Memories Flamenco in Cayo Coco next May!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jannahurren@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.101.125.237","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1396295342,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277424.jpg?_r=1401464547","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jlc3","Id":277424,"Name":"jlc3","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.196.140.73","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73737,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2427b97196e345b3b6cd530b366f619c","RawContent":"Hey!\n\n\nI&#039;m January 12-2015 :) \n\nThis is where we were engaged! I love the resort, stunning beach and gorgeous pier facing the ocean!\n\nPerfect!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1872559,"PostDate":1411351025,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey!<br><br>\nI'm January 12-2015 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br>\nThis is where we were engaged! I love the resort, stunning beach and gorgeous pier facing the ocean!<br>\nPerfect!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"turningturcotte@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.196.140.73","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411350240,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"CubaBride2be","Id":279925,"Name":"CubaBride2be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.89.236.44","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73737,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5e29fcdc1d795fa8f0a40a1a6e9e9b1d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1884890,"PostDate":1422839930,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"njwood000@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.7.173.185","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1405824791,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Msmimi","Id":279087,"Name":"Msmimi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.244.52.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73737,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6463b6ba109a062931e7d025be99fd1d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve never been but researched both extensively when I was looking at resorts... I also had a friend who stayed at the Caribe. Apparently although the Caribe is nice, Flamenco comes out on top. The resort is newer and has good food. The downside to Flamenco is the beach, which tends to be rockier but apparently they have been working on improving it. But even then, you walk out 10 ft and its really nice sand.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also, a review I saw for Flamenco showed the snorkeling is really nice there. Look up some youtube videos on it! :)\n\n\n&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.tripadvisor.ca\/ShowTopic-g580450-i10244-k6800515-Memories_Flamenco_vs_Memories_Caribe_Help-Cayo_Coco_Jardines_del_Rey_Archipelago_Ciego_de_.html&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.tripadvisor.ca\/ShowTopic-g580450-i10244-k6800515-Memories_Flamenco_vs_Memories_Caribe_Help-Cayo_Coco_Jardines_del_Rey_Archipelago_Ciego_de_.html&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1885390,"PostDate":1423181996,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I've never been but researched both extensively when I was looking at resorts... I also had a friend who stayed at the Caribe. Apparently although the Caribe is nice, Flamenco comes out on top. The resort is newer and has good food. The downside to Flamenco is the beach, which tends to be rockier but apparently they have been working on improving it. But even then, you walk out 10 ft and its really nice sand.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also, a review I saw for Flamenco showed the snorkeling is really nice there. Look up some youtube videos on it! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\n<a href='http:\/\/www.tripadvisor.ca\/ShowTopic-g580450-i10244-k6800515-Memories_Flamenco_vs_Memories_Caribe_Help-Cayo_Coco_Jardines_del_Rey_Archipelago_Ciego_de_.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.tripadvis..._Ciego_de_.html<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"empty_xo@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.244.52.21","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1416697537,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Brandii","Id":281229,"Name":"Brandii","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"73737","Title":"Memories Flamenco or Memories Caribe Brides","LastPostDate":1423181996},"Pages":{"TotalItems":6,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
