Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":9,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":652,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1786424,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":272165,"Name":"Stanicka","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272165.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1375444993,"LastPoster":{"Id":279185,"Name":"081114OVCUBA","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279185.jpg?_r=1408922571","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":299,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":48,"Preview":{"Id":1864183,"PostDate":1407021415,"PostContent":"@Stanicka \u00a0 Our WC has been taking care of everything for us, it has been so easy. \u00a0 All we had t...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mandie_blackman@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"206.75.104.157","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406494597,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279185.jpg?_r=1408922571","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":299,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"081114OVCUBA","Id":279185,"Name":"081114OVCUBA","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74740,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0df0a5933fb4b0f362e000ffb10a2a22","RawContent":"Can someone please provide me with the list of documents that are needed before arriving in Cuba? Do documents vary depending on the country your coming from or are they all the same???? Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":1786424,"PostDate":1375444993,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Can someone please provide me with the list of documents that are needed before arriving in Cuba? Do documents vary depending on the country your coming from or are they all the same???? Thanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stanicka86@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1375434101,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272165.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Stanicka","Id":272165,"Name":"Stanicka","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74740,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4094c5aa671085a11b956b36934baef9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello, not sure if you have found your answer yet, but my wedding coordinator at the Blau Varadero told me she takes care of all of our documents for us. What we do need to do, though, is provide her with our info, and our witnesses info prior to the wedding. She will need copies of all of&amp;nbsp;our passports, and copies of the bride and grooms birth certificates two months prior. But that&#039;s all she needs from us! Hope this helps you!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Jackie&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1805178,"PostDate":1381099101,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello, not sure if you have found your answer yet, but my wedding coordinator at the Blau Varadero told me she takes care of all of our documents for us. What we do need to do, though, is provide her with our info, and our witnesses info prior to the wedding. She will need copies of all of\u00a0our passports, and copies of the bride and grooms birth certificates two months prior. But that's all she needs from us! Hope this helps you!<\/p> <p>Jackie<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jackieshaynewedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.64.43.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1369770017,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270054.jpg?_r=1391705350","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jackshayne0123","Id":270054,"Name":"jackshayne0123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74740,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"68626b651f05ff658f491c50723e4b59","RawContent":"Hello, Don&#039;t we need to have our documents translated? I believe we need a copy of our birth certificate, passport and a certificate of single status. I think we need to send them to the cuban embassy. Has anyone else had to do this?","Attachments":[],"Id":1808490,"PostDate":1382356136,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello, Don't we need to have our documents translated? I believe we need a copy of our birth certificate, passport and a certificate of single status. I think we need to send them to the cuban embassy. Has anyone else had to do this?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"spayne@live.ca","IpAddress":"65.181.37.96","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1382286139,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274397.jpg?_r=1393506925","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Sarah Payne","Id":274397,"Name":"Sarah Payne","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74740,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bd0a35f628099a5bd71278da83fa1b8f","RawContent":"Hello, Don&#039;t we need to have our documents translated? I believe we need a copy of our birth certificate, passport and a certificate of single status. I think we need to send them to the cuban embassy. Has anyone else had to do this?","Attachments":[],"Id":1808491,"PostDate":1382356146,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello, Don't we need to have our documents translated? I believe we need a copy of our birth certificate, passport and a certificate of single status. I think we need to send them to the cuban embassy. Has anyone else had to do this?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"spayne@live.ca","IpAddress":"65.181.37.96","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1382286139,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274397.jpg?_r=1393506925","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Sarah Payne","Id":274397,"Name":"Sarah Payne","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74740,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"383a3b22baee5091349b95256a4a3208","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Sarah Payne&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n Hello,\n \n \n Don&#039;t we need to have our documents translated? I believe we need a copy of our birth certificate, passport and a certificate of single status. I think we need to send them to the cuban embassy. Has anyone else had to do this?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;Hi! Our wedding planner takes care of everything, the documents are translated and then mailed to us back home. I&#039;ve been told it will take 4-5 months to get our wedding cert. back. My WC hasn&#039;t said anything about a certificate of single status. But if either of us have been divorced or widowed, she would need those docs too. But all we do is send our stuff to her, including our witness info, and she takes care of the rest.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1808982,"PostDate":1382494487,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>Sarah Payne<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Hello,<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Don't we need to have our documents translated? I believe we need a copy of our birth certificate, passport and a certificate of single status. I think we need to send them to the cuban embassy. Has anyone else had to do this?<\/div> <\/div> <p>Hi! Our wedding planner takes care of everything, the documents are translated and then mailed to us back home. I've been told it will take 4-5 months to get our wedding cert. back. My WC hasn't said anything about a certificate of single status. But if either of us have been divorced or widowed, she would need those docs too. But all we do is send our stuff to her, including our witness info, and she takes care of the rest.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jackieshaynewedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.64.43.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1369770017,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270054.jpg?_r=1391705350","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jackshayne0123","Id":270054,"Name":"jackshayne0123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.234.136.182","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74740,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"500ec295173bcdaab28f26fb20039d06","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Oh wow, some really helpful information here. &amp;nbsp;I was wondering the same thing. &amp;nbsp;Is it true that it takes about 6 months for you to get your marriage certificate mailed back to you? &amp;nbsp;Do you have to wait to get it before you can change your name? &amp;nbsp;Sorry to pile more questions upon the original question.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- Dia&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1834685,"PostDate":1392863541,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Oh wow, some really helpful information here. \u00a0I was wondering the same thing. \u00a0Is it true that it takes about 6 months for you to get your marriage certificate mailed back to you? \u00a0Do you have to wait to get it before you can change your name? \u00a0Sorry to pile more questions upon the original question.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>- Dia<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;484\/st\/20150924\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/8745\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>My Planning Thread:<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79153-diadiamonds-planning-thread-iberostar-varadero-cuba-sept242015\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79153-diadiamonds-planning-thread-iberostar-varadero-cuba-sept242015\/<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n","Email":"fadia.daniel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"76.64.81.211","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1392664043,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276748.jpg?_r=1392867144","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"diadiamond","Id":276748,"Name":"diadiamond","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.89.160.93","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74740,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"27ec1ad22d67a96b69c9f59d3c8dd61e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"diadiamond\" post=\"1834685\" timestamp=\"1392863541\"]\nOh wow, some really helpful information here.  I was wondering the same thing.  Is it true that it takes about 6 months for you to get your marriage certificate mailed back to you?  Do you have to wait to get it before you can change your name?  Sorry to pile more questions upon the original question.\n\n- Dia[\/quote]Hi! Yes, my wedding coordinator said it will take about 5-6 months for us to get our marriage cert. We were married a month ago, I&#039;m not expecting my papers until June. Yes to legally change your name, drivers license, passport etc. you will need your marriage cert.","Attachments":[],"Id":1834752,"PostDate":1392916124,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>diadiamond, on 19 February 2014 - 06:32 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Oh wow, some really helpful information here. \u00a0I was wondering the same thing. \u00a0Is it true that it takes about 6 months for you to get your marriage certificate mailed back to you? \u00a0Do you have to wait to get it before you can change your name? \u00a0Sorry to pile more questions upon the original question.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>- Dia<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hi! Yes, my wedding coordinator said it will take about 5-6 months for us to get our marriage cert. We were married a month ago, I'm not expecting my papers until June. Yes to legally change your name, drivers license, passport\u00a0etc. you will need your marriage cert.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jackieshaynewedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.64.43.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1369770017,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270054.jpg?_r=1391705350","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jackshayne0123","Id":270054,"Name":"jackshayne0123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.234.136.182","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74740,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7a9fc9ad5b07d667ad4fcf67930a4c81","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks hun! &amp;nbsp;After learning about that I&#039;ll have to talk it over with the fiancee to decide if we want to legal wedding here or in Cuba. &amp;nbsp;I think there are advantages and disadvantages to both. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m planning to change my last name once I&#039;m married.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1834788,"PostDate":1392925690,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks hun! \u00a0After learning about that I'll have to talk it over with the fiancee to decide if we want to legal wedding here or in Cuba. \u00a0I think there are advantages and disadvantages to both. \u00a0I'm planning to change my last name once I'm married.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;484\/st\/20150924\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/8745\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>My Planning Thread:<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79153-diadiamonds-planning-thread-iberostar-varadero-cuba-sept242015\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79153-diadiamonds-planning-thread-iberostar-varadero-cuba-sept242015\/<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n","Email":"fadia.daniel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"76.64.81.211","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1392664043,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276748.jpg?_r=1392867144","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"diadiamond","Id":276748,"Name":"diadiamond","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.75.104.157","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74740,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ec2ce9e3ef142f108411902433e27caa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Stanicka\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Our WC has been taking care of everything for us, it has been so easy.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;All we had to do&amp;nbsp;was fill out a questionnaire (one each for myself, FI, and each witness) and send copies of all of our passports. On top of that we had to send a copy of our birth certificates and if applicable would have had to send documentation of previous divorce or death certificates etc. Our WC takes these and gets them translated etc. before we get there and then all they have to do if verify our actual documents when we arrive.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;As soon as you have picked your location and held your marriage date, the WC should be able to walk you though the rest. Don&#039;t worry, they do this full time all the time - they are experts! Our WC has taken all of our worries away for these kinds of things.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Cheers!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1864183,"PostDate":1407021415,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"272165\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/272165-stanicka\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Stanicka<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Our WC has been taking care of everything for us, it has been so easy.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>All we had to do\u00a0was fill out a questionnaire (one each for myself, FI, and each witness) and send copies of all of our passports. On top of that we had to send a copy of our birth certificates and if applicable would have had to send documentation of previous divorce or death certificates etc. Our WC takes these and gets them translated etc. before we get there and then all they have to do if verify our actual documents when we arrive.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>As soon as you have picked your location and held your marriage date, the WC should be able to walk you though the rest. Don't worry, they do this full time all the time - they are experts! Our WC has taken all of our worries away for these kinds of things.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Cheers!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mandie_blackman@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"206.75.104.157","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406494597,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279185.jpg?_r=1408922571","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":299,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"081114OVCUBA","Id":279185,"Name":"081114OVCUBA","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"74740","Title":"Necessary documents for a Cuban Wedding","LastPostDate":1407021415},"Pages":{"TotalItems":9,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
