son":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a818a16a0776274fe56a8b3678c2b933","RawContent":"Hi Everyone!\n \n I am just getting started with this fun wedding planning and am really needing some software help. I have been looking at a few different planning softwares out there and was curious what people from here have used!\n \n I read the I Do link, and actually have that free trial, but am having problems finding something that works best for having a destination wedding, and then having a reception back at home a couple months later.\n \n Soooo....what have YOU used? What did you like\/not like? \n \n Thanks everyone for the help....and have a GREAT day!!!\n \n Amy","Attachments":[],"Id":214854,"PostDate":1204572586,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Everyone!<br \/> <br \/> I am just getting started with this fun wedding planning and am really needing some software help. I have been looking at a few different planning softwares out there and was curious what people from here have used!<br \/> <br \/> I read the I Do link, and actually have that free trial, but am having problems finding something that works best for having a destination wedding, and then having a reception back at home a couple months later.<br \/> <br \/> Soooo....what have YOU used? What did you like\/not like? <br \/> <br \/> Thanks everyone for the help....and have a GREAT day!!!<br \/> <br \/> Amy\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheig